insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The new system was adopted not because it was cheaper, but because it made the process more transparent in public institutions, as described in a pilot study in a coastal student forum context.','The main reason for adopting the new system was improved transparency rather than lower cost.','The new system was rejected because it was not transparent.','The process became less transparent after the new system was adopted.','The new system was adopted mainly because it reduced costs.','A','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_34", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'Even though the experiment was small, its results raised important questions for future research during periods of change, as described in a professional workshop in a urban student forum context.','The results were ignored because the experiment was not small.','Despite its limited size, the experiment produced results that future studies should examine.','Future research became unnecessary after the experiment.','The experiment was too large to raise useful questions.','B','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_34", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The passage implies that convenience may encourage people to use a service, but it does not guarantee satisfaction in small communities, as described in a policy review in a northern student forum context.','The passage denies that convenience affects service use.','The passage argues that inconvenient services attract the most users.','The passage suggests that a convenient service can attract users without necessarily satisfying them.','The passage says convenience always guarantees satisfaction.','C','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_34", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The committee approved the plan only after several risks had been identified and addressed when resources are limited, as described in a classroom discussion in a southern student forum context.','The committee approved the plan before considering any risks.','The plan was accepted although no risks were identified.','The committee rejected the plan because all risks were addressed.','The plan was accepted once the committee had dealt with the risks it found.','D','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_34", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The decline in complaints was gradual, so managers were careful not to attribute it to a single change under careful supervision, as described in a research summary in a central student forum context.','Because complaints decreased slowly, managers avoided saying that one change alone caused the improvement.','Managers ignored the decline because it was caused by one change.','Managers blamed a single change because complaints rose quickly.','The decline in complaints was sudden and easy to explain.','A','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_34", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The writer contrasts short-term popularity with long-term reliability after initial trials, as described in a public debate in a online student forum context.','The writer discusses reliability without mentioning popularity.','The writer points out a difference between being popular now and being dependable over time.','The writer says popularity and reliability are exactly the same.','The writer argues that long-term reliability is impossible.','B','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_34", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'Although bilingual education was initially criticized, later evidence showed that it could be useful when applied carefully in schools, as described in a training program.','Early criticism proved that bilingual education had no value at all.','Later evidence showed that bilingual education should never be applied.','Later evidence suggested that bilingual education, despite early criticism, may have value if used carefully.','The usefulness of bilingual education was accepted before anyone criticized it.','C','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_34", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The report does not claim that museum apps solves every problem; it argues only that it can reduce one specific difficulty for adult learners, as described in an evaluation report.','The report argues that museum apps solves all problems completely.','The report discusses many solutions but never mentions a specific problem.','The report rejects the idea that museum apps can help in any way.','According to the report, museum apps is not a complete solution but may help with a particular problem.','D','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_34", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'Researchers postponed their recommendation because the available data were too limited to support a firm conclusion in public institutions, as described in a committee meeting in a advanced student forum context.','The researchers delayed giving advice since the evidence was insufficient for a definite conclusion.','The researchers made a recommendation because the data were complete.','The available data forced the researchers to reject all conclusions.','The researchers postponed collecting data after reaching a firm conclusion.','A','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_34", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
