insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The passage implies that convenience may encourage people to use a service, but it does not guarantee satisfaction in schools, as described in a training program in a advanced training course context.','The passage says convenience always guarantees satisfaction.','The passage argues that inconvenient services attract the most users.','The passage suggests that a convenient service can attract users without necessarily satisfying them.','The passage denies that convenience affects service use.','C','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_38", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The committee approved the plan only after several risks had been identified and addressed for adult learners, as described in an evaluation report in a introductory training course context.','The committee approved the plan before considering any risks.','The plan was accepted although no risks were identified.','The committee rejected the plan because all risks were addressed.','The plan was accepted once the committee had dealt with the risks it found.','D','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_38", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The writer contrasts short-term popularity with long-term reliability after initial trials, as described in a pilot study in a coastal student forum context.','The writer points out a difference between being popular now and being dependable over time.','The writer discusses reliability without mentioning popularity.','The writer says popularity and reliability are exactly the same.','The writer argues that long-term reliability is impossible.','A','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_39", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'Although school uniforms was initially criticized, later evidence showed that it could be useful when applied carefully in schools, as described in a professional workshop.','Later evidence showed that school uniforms should never be applied.','Later evidence suggested that school uniforms, despite early criticism, may have value if used carefully.','Early criticism proved that school uniforms had no value at all.','The usefulness of school uniforms was accepted before anyone criticized it.','B','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_39", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The report does not claim that community gardens solves every problem; it argues only that it can reduce one specific difficulty for adult learners, as described in a policy review.','The report rejects the idea that community gardens can help in any way.','The report argues that community gardens solves all problems completely.','According to the report, community gardens is not a complete solution but may help with a particular problem.','The report discusses many solutions but never mentions a specific problem.','C','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_39", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'Researchers postponed their recommendation because the available data were too limited to support a firm conclusion in public institutions, as described in a classroom discussion in a southern student forum context.','The researchers postponed collecting data after reaching a firm conclusion.','The available data forced the researchers to reject all conclusions.','The researchers made a recommendation because the data were complete.','The researchers delayed giving advice since the evidence was insufficient for a definite conclusion.','D','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_39", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
